@host = https://localhost:7320

### POC 1 - Reset 20 Orders
POST {{host}}/api/orders/setup-correctness

### POC 1 - Offset page 1 -> 1..5
GET {{host}}/api/orders/offset?page=1&pageSize=5

### POC 1 - Delete a row already seen
DELETE {{host}}/api/orders/3

### POC 1 - Offset page 2 -> 7..11; Order 6 is skipped
GET {{host}}/api/orders/offset?page=2&pageSize=5

### Reset before Keyset scenario
POST {{host}}/api/orders/setup-correctness

### POC 1 - Keyset first page -> 1..5; cursor 5
GET {{host}}/api/orders/keyset?lastId=0&pageSize=5

### Same concurrent change
DELETE {{host}}/api/orders/3

### POC 1 - Keyset next page -> 6..10
GET {{host}}/api/orders/keyset?lastId=5&pageSize=5

### POC 2 - after running setup-performance.sql
GET {{host}}/api/orders/performance/offset?page=50000&pageSize=20

### Same 20 rows with Keyset
GET {{host}}/api/orders/performance/keyset?lastId=999980&pageSize=20
